                    320.0,
                    752.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In years after such full funding transfer, the section 401(h) account shall be fully funded on an annual basis from excess pension assets or Company contributions as the FAS 108 liabilities are recalculated as a result of experience or changed assumptions.",
